WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.998 --> 00:00:03.344
- What I do is more than a manicure,

00:00:03.344 --> 00:00:05.043
it's micro-activism.

00:00:05.043 --> 00:00:07.105
You can be cute and multi-faceted

00:00:07.105 --> 00:00:09.522
and vocal about your message.

00:00:11.864 --> 00:00:13.024
(uptempo instrumental music)

00:00:13.024 --> 00:00:14.057
My name is Ami Vega

00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:16.613
and I'm a nail artist
out of New York City.

00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:18.676
I became a nail artist by chance.

00:00:18.676 --> 00:00:20.756
It was always something I did for myself,

00:00:20.756 --> 00:00:22.390
since I was maybe 13 years old,

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.720
and I thought about it,

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.341
and I wanted to pursue it more seriously,

00:00:25.341 --> 00:00:27.862
so I went to nail school
and got my license.

00:00:27.862 --> 00:00:29.315
So, I work on fashion shoots,

00:00:29.315 --> 00:00:31.593
but nail art is mostly what I do.

00:00:31.593 --> 00:00:33.562
I think socially conscious
nail art is important

00:00:33.562 --> 00:00:36.136
now more than ever because
of the things going on,

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:38.680
not just in our country
but all around the world.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.646
Everything under Black Lives
Matter, women's rights,

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:43.905
LGBT rights, women's health,

00:00:43.905 --> 00:00:48.866
domestic violence against
women is also another one.

00:00:48.866 --> 00:00:50.006
No matter what you have on your nails,

00:00:50.006 --> 00:00:51.979
they bring attention.

00:00:51.979 --> 00:00:53.999
It brings your eyes to their nails.

00:00:53.999 --> 00:00:56.267
It kind of brings the
conversation into real life.

00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:58.509
Nowadays, we depend so
much on social media,

00:00:58.509 --> 00:01:00.293
and it kind of just
brings that interaction

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.747
of person-to-person.

00:01:01.747 --> 00:01:03.961
Somebody will see your
nail art and wanna inquire,

00:01:03.961 --> 00:01:05.519
and then you have a
moment and an opportunity

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:07.602
to talk about that topic.

00:01:09.395 --> 00:01:11.950
It's more than just being
cute and having cute nails,

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.231
it's having a message and
feeling strong about it,

00:01:14.231 --> 00:01:15.409
and be vocal about it.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:18.125
As a woman, sometimes we're made to be

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:19.199
a bit more submissive,

00:01:19.199 --> 00:01:21.537
and this is a way of kind getting strength

00:01:21.537 --> 00:01:22.553
in our own messages

00:01:22.553 --> 00:01:24.567
and saying, "Hey, I am gonna be cute,

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.027
"but I also have a message to say,

00:01:27.027 --> 00:01:28.111
"and I'm gonna wear it on my fingers,"

00:01:28.111 --> 00:01:28.944
you know?

00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:32.633
To be an activist means to
feel strongly about something,

00:01:32.633 --> 00:01:34.371
whatever it may be.

00:01:34.371 --> 00:01:35.204
More than anything,

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:37.307
staying true to yourself and your message.

00:01:37.307 --> 00:01:41.140
(uptempo instrumental music)

